        "heading_raw": "Prerequisites",
        "body_raw": "Bluff 5 ranks."
      },
      {
        "heading_raw": "Benefit",
        "body_raw": "You can use the Bluff skill to demoralize opponents in combat instead of Intimidate. You can attempt a Bluff check in place of an Intimidate check when using the Dazzling Display feat and feats that list Dazzling Display as a prerequisite. If you use the Bluff skill to demoralize, you cannot use it to feint until the beginning of your next turn, and vice versa."
      }
